msgstr "Plugins Premium"

#: inc/settings/pages/glg-premium-plugins.php:13
msgid ""
"Take your website to the next level with our Premium Plugins, which gives "
"you additional features more than you expected."
msgstr ""
"Tomar su sitio de Internet al siguiente nivel con nuestros Plugins Premium, "
"que le da características adicionales más de lo que esperaba."

